nancial crime together” — as our regulators expect. \n\nThis is why we went public ‼️‼️‼️‼️\n\nDon’t say I didn’t tell you. \n\nIt all makes sense now, through the help of this community, we have potentially helped so many vulnerable customers crying out for help. \n\nPass it on. Watch your accounts 🐍 \n\n•\n•\n•\n\n#nab #fraud #internalfraud #westpac #forensicsccounting","acc":"Photo by SENSE OF HER. by Dani LoCastro on November 26, 2026. May be a graphic of poster, crossword puzzle and text.","n":null,"slides":[{"mt":1,"img":"https://instagram.fbne11-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t51.82787-15/917082563_18395188984234944_3629303519715809054_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_tt6&_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ig_cache_key=NDAzOTQyNzYzMjE4MTAwMzU4Mg%3D%3D.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkZFRUQueHBpZHMuMTM1MC5zZHIucmVndWxhcl9waG90by5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=S1GSkNinFMQQ7kNvwF5ro5d&_nc_oc=Adq_YdoS6hH9TZrbhNBdlrW7Oeoko0-cAIjlYo_LHBrD5SMgumxzzcBNKKzxRZr517g&_nc_ad=z-m&_nc_cid=0&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=instagram.fbne11-1.fna&_nc_gid=3obbAyw6mJiUP668kPn3sw&_nc_ss=7a32e&_nc_ct=RQosPBUIFQIlBAAAAA&oh=00_AQUafIOArfmTab6YvYKg5TegnwkcgqVacNhOaDw-RrRpqw&oe=6B0F9599","acc":"Photo by SENSE OF HER. by Dani LoCastro on November 26, 2026. May be a graphic of poster, crossword puzzle and text."}]},"DgO5jCTCHnt":{"code":"DgO5jCTCHnt","t":1795756377,"mt":2,"cap":"This is how you know @nab 🚩\n\nPsych safety may be unseen. \n\nBut it’s definitely felt, and its impacts ripple into all areas of our lives. \n\n•\n•\n•\n\n#nab #westpac #anz #commbank #big4","acc":null,"n":null,"slides":[{"mt":2,"img":"https://instagram.fbne11-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t51.71878-15/931977770_1152641047388218_4012617789335191300_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ig_cache_key=NDAzOTQxOTAxMjA5NzUzODU0MTE4ODQ3OTQ4MDI2NzQ5ODg%3D.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjY0MC5zZHIudmlkZW9fZmlyc3RfZnJhbWVfdGh1bWJuYWlsLkMzIn0%3D&_nc_ohc=XtEpWsL0lTwQ7kNvwH6i5BN&_nc_oc=AdpW5Wlz